cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "obr: Access 'Office for Budget Responsibility' Data"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Coverdale
    given-names: Charles
    email: charlesfcoverdale@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/charlescoverdale/obr"
url: "https://charlescoverdale.github.io/obr/"
version: 0.4.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Provides clean, tidy access to data published by the Office for
  Budget Responsibility, the UK's independent fiscal watchdog. Covers
  the Public Finances Databank, the Historical Official Forecasts
  Database, the Economic and Fiscal Outlook detailed forecast tables,
  the Welfare Trends Report, and the Fiscal Risks and Sustainability
  Report. Returns objects with attached provenance (source URL,
  publication vintage, retrieval timestamp, and file fingerprint) so
  analyses can be audited and reproduced.
keywords:
  - r
  - fiscal-policy
  - public-finances
  - office-for-budget-responsibility
  - obr
  - cran
  - united-kingdom
